* lna-a3-cascode-peak: cascode NMOS LNA with shunt peaking inductor.
* Replaces push-pull with cascode structure for higher output impedance.
* Input DC-blocked (C4), output via shunt peaking inductor (L3) and resistor (R6).
C C4 VIN1 n0
L L1 n0 n1
NMOS NM1 n1 n2 VSS VSS
R R6 n2 VOUT1
L L3 n2 VSS
C C1 n1 n3
PMOS PM1 n3 VDD VDD VDD
C C2 n3 VSS
C C3 n1 VOUT1
R R1 VDD n5
NMOS NM3 n5 n5 VSS VSS
R R2 n5 n1